Scenario: Remove account entitlement
	Koroneiki account entitlements should be able to be removed.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                              | |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki | |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                         | |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                 | |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                         | |
	| Region       | United States                        | |
	| Status       | Active                               | |
	| Tier         | T4                                   | |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com          | |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}   |                |
	| Perpetual               | true               |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1    | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2    | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3    | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                  |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate} |                |
	And I create an account entitlement definition related to the product purchase of the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name        |
	| Status      | Approved                |
	Then the account entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name" should be present with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name        |
	| Status      | Approved                |
	And the account entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name" should be present via the entitlement definition key with the following values
	| Description | Entitlement Description |
	| Name        | Entitlement Name        |
	| Status      | Approved                |
	When I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name"
	And I delete a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform"
	And I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Entitlement Name"
	Then the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Entitlement Name" should not be visible via nested field on the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

